about:
  paragraphs:
    - "Computer Science graduate from TUM and Founding Engineer at p(doom). Working on adaptive compute in reasoning LLMs and building embodied AI systems."
    - "Background spans enterprise software engineering, deep learning research, and teaching. Active in building student communities and initiatives at the intersection of AI, robotics, and system resilience."

